{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-1","title":"1 Timothy 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 That it is meet to pray and give thanks for all men, and the reason why. 9 How women should be attired. 12 They are not permitted to teach. 15 They shall be saved, notwithstanding the testimonies of God's wrath, in childbirth, if they continue in faith.</p>\n<p>exhort. or, desire. 2Co 8:6; Eph 3:13; Heb 6:11 first. 1Co 15:3 supplications. 5:5; Ge 18:23-32; 1Ki 8:41-43; Ps 67:1-4; 72:19; Mt 6:9,10; Jas 5:16 and. Ro 1:8; 6:17; Eph 5:20; Php 1:3; 2Th 1:3 all men. 4; Ac 17:30; 1Th 3:12; 2Ti 2:24; Tit 2:11; 3:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-2","title":"1 Timothy 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>kings. Ezr 6:10; Ne 1:11; Ps 20:1-4; 72:1; Jer 29:7 for all. Ro 13:1-7; 1Pe 2:13 authority. or, eminent place. that. Ge 49:14,15; 2Sa 20:19; Pr 24:21; Ec 3:12,13; 8:2-5; Ro 12:18 1Th 4:11; Heb 12:14 all godliness. Lu 1:6; 2:25; Ac 10:22; 24:16; Php 4:8; Tit 2:10-14; 1Pe 2:9-13 2Pe 1:3-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-3","title":"1 Timothy 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>this. 5:4; Ro 12:1,2; 14:18; Eph 5:9,10; Php 1:11; 4:18; Col 1:10; 1Th 4:1 Heb 13:16; 1Pe 2:5,20 God. 1:1; Isa 45:21; Lu 1:47; 2Ti 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-4","title":"1 Timothy 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>will. Isa 45:22; 49:6; 55:1; Eze 18:23,32; 33:11; Lu 14:23; Joh 3:15-17 Joh 6:37; Ro 3:29,30; 2Co 5:17-19; 1Th 2:15,16; Tit 2:11; 2Pe 3:9 and. Mt 28:19; Mr 16:15; Lu 24:47; Ro 10:12-15; Re 14:6 the knowledge. Isa 53:11; Hab 2:14; Lu 1:77; Joh 14:6; 17:17; 2Ti 2:25; 3:7 Heb 10:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-5","title":"1 Timothy 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>one God. De 6:4; Isa 44:6; Mr 12:29-33; Joh 17:3; Ro 3:29,30; 10:12; 1Co 8:6 Ga 3:20; Eph 4:6 and. Job 9:33; Heb 7:25; 8:6; 9:15; 12:24 the man. Mt 1:23; Lu 2:10,11; Joh 1:14; 1Co 15:45-47; Php 2:6-8; Heb 2:6-13 Re 1:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-6","title":"1 Timothy 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>gave. Job 33:24; Isa 53:6; Mt 20:28; Mr 10:45; Joh 6:51; 10:15 2Co 5:14,15,21; Eph 1:7,17; 5:2; Tit 2:14; Heb 9:12; 1Pe 1:18,19 1Pe 2:24; 3:18; 1Jo 2:1,2; 4:10; Re 1:5; 5:9 to be testified. or, a testimony. 1Co 1:6; 2Th 1:10; 2Ti 1:8; 1Jo 5:11,12 in. 6:15; Ro 5:6; 16:26; Ga 4:4; Eph 1:9,10; 3:5; Tit 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-7","title":"1 Timothy 2:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>I am. 1:11,12 a preacher. Ec 1:1,2,12; 7:27; 12:8-10; Ro 10:14; Eph 3:7,8; 2Ti 1:11; 2Pe 2:5 I speak. Ro 1:9; 9:1; 2Co 11:31; Ga 1:20 a teacher. Joh 7:35; Ac 9:15; 22:21; 26:17,18,20; Ro 11:13; 15:16; Ga 1:16; 2:9 in faith. Ac 14:27; Ga 2:16; 3:9 verity. Ps 111:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-8","title":"1 Timothy 2:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>I will. 5:14; 1Co 7:7; *Gr: Tit 3:8 pray. 2Ch 33:11,12; Ps 130:1,2; La 3:55,56; Jon 2:1,2; Mal 1:11 Lu 23:42,43; Joh 4:21,23,24; Ac 21:5 lifting. Job 16:17; Ps 26:6; 66:18; 134:2; Pr 15:8; 21:27; Isa 1:15; 58:7-11 Jer 7:9,10; Mal 1:9,10; Ac 10:2,4,31; Heb 10:22; Jas 4:8 1Jo 3:20-22 without. 1Ki 3:11; Ps 35:13; Mt 5:22-24,44; 6:12,14,15; Mr 11:25; Lu 23:34 Ac 7:60; 1Pe 3:7 and. Mt 21:21; Mr 11:23,24; Jas 1:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-9","title":"1 Timothy 2:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>that. 1Pe 3:3-5 with shamefacedness. Pr 7:10; Isa 3:16; Tit 2:3-5 not. Ge 24:53; Ex 35:22,23; 2Ki 9:30; Es 5:1; Ps 45:13,14; 149:4 Pr 31:22; Isa 3:18-24; 61:4; Jer 2:32; 4:30; Eze 16:9-16; Mt 6:28 Mt 6:29; 11:8 broidered. or, plaited. 1Pe 3:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-10","title":"1 Timothy 2:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>women. 1Pe 3:3-5; 2Pe 3:11 with. 5:6-10; Pr 31:31; Ac 9:36,39; Eph 2:10; Tit 2:14; 3:8; 1Pe 2:12 2Pe 1:6-8; Re 2:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-11","title":"1 Timothy 2:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Ge 3:16; Es 1:20; 1Co 11:3; 14:34,35; Eph 5:22-24; Col 3:18 1Pe 3:1,5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-13","title":"1 Timothy 2:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Ge 1:27; 2:7,18,22; 1Co 11:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-14","title":"1 Timothy 2:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Ge 3:6,12; 2Co 11:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-2-15","title":"1 Timothy 2:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>she. Ge 3:15; Isa 7:14; 9:6; Jer 31:22; Mt 1:21-25; Lu 2:7,10,11 Ga 4:4,5 in child-bearing. Ge 3:16 in faith. 1:5 sobriety. 9; Tit 2:12; 1Pe 4:7</p>"}]}